@action
title: Soviet Floor Manager
subtitle: Dan whips the votes in the Soviet and prepares the speeches. [? if player_party = 'menshevik' : Support among workers +3, soldiers +3, railwaymen +2; soviet democracy +1; the Revolutionary Defencists: strength +1, dissent −1. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' : Support among workers +3, soldiers +3, railwaymen +2; soviet democracy +1; the Centre: strength +1, dissent −1. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.month_actions += 1;
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 3, soldiers: 3, railway: 2}); RO.add(Q, {soviet_democracy: 1}); RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 1, -1);
!}

Dan has organised the speakers, the resolutions and the votes. The Soviet runs a little more smoothly, and our delegates are better prepared.

